<title>USA: Summit Technology Q4 oper shr loss.</title>
<headline>Summit Technology Q4 oper shr loss.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>SUMMIT TECHNOLOGY, INC</p>
<p>				  (in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>				  Three Months Ended    Year Ended</p>
<p>			     12/31/96 12/31/95    12/31/96 12/13/95</p>
<p> Total revenue	  $17,878  $ 26,778 $ 80,477	$95,898</p>
<p> Cost of revenue	 17,702    16,177   62,438	 61,358</p>
<p> Gross profit		 176    10,601   18,039	 34,540</p>
<p> Operating expenses     7,304     8,138   30,694	 31,360</p>
<p> Legal expenses	   2,392	 860    6,009	  2,295</p>
