<p> continuing operations (9,520)     1,603  (18,664)	  885</p>
<p> Other income	     1,136	 838    5,173	    690</p>
<p>Income (loss) from continuing</p>
<p>  operations	    (8,384)     2,441  (13,491)	 1,575</p>
