<p>Note: The 1995 amounts have been restated to reflect the discontinuation of the company's Vision Center business and the acquisition of Lens Express Inc.</p>
<p>Loss from discontinued operations for the fourth quarter 1996 included a $4.6 million provision for operating losses during the phase-out period of the Vision Center business.</p>
